{"ts":"2026-07-13T09:31:04.679Z","author":"maintainer-agent","op":"create","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-wg07"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"Public-surface consistency pass: runtime floor, SDK authoring docs, generated counts, storage/TOON wording, naming hierarchy"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"Verify and reconcile every public-surface inconsistency flagged by the 2026-07 strategy review across README, website (pm-cli.unbrained.dev), npm metadata, and plugin docs. Trust is a prerequisite for agent and SDK adoption; drift here undermines the category claim. Independent of the category ADR — ships regardless."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Chore"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":1},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["docs","drift","trust","website"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-07-13T09:31:04.679Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-07-13T09:31:04.679Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"maintainer-agent"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/estimated_minutes","value":300},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"Each flagged drift verified then fixed or refuted with evidence; runtime requirement rendered from package.json engines (verified 2026-07-13: >=22.18.0; repo docs already consistent — website/plugin copy still to check) with an explicit product decision on lowering vs communicating the floor; stale compiled-JS/dist SDK authoring content deleted or versioned in favor of the TypeScript-native loader story (pm-2p7a); every public count generated from pm contracts + package catalog with labeled units; storage wording standardized to 'TOON writes; legacy Markdown reads for migration'; TOON promise phrased as 'sparse deterministic projection optimized for agent context; full JSON available' not 'only changed fields'; naming follows